<title>USA: United Tech Q4 revs up in most units.</title>
<headline>United Tech Q4 revs up in most units.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies Corp said Thursday that fourth quarter revenues rose in all its business segments except that of Flight Systems.</p>
<p>The company reported operating profits rose 18 percent for its Pratt &amp; Whitney business, four percent for its carrier business and 12 percent for its Flight Systems business, whose operating profits rose despite the segments falling revenues.</p>
